<title>USA: Gillete shares jump before Q1 report.</title>
<headline>Gillete shares jump before Q1 report.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gillette Co shares rose over five percent on Wednesday in anticipation the consumer products company would post strong first quarter results after Colgate-Palmolive reported earnings that beat expectations, analysts said.</p>
<p>&quot;I think there's a connection (to Colgate), but more, there's a lot of anticipation,&quot; J.P. Morgan analyst Michael Grant said. &quot;People expect good things&quot; from Gillette's first quarter earnings report due Thursday.</p>
<p>Gillette rose 4-1/8 to 81-3/4.</p>
</text>
